s://finance.yahoo.com/markets/commodities/articles/gold-rebounds-14-mth-low-034554107.html  ### Mike McGlone Says Crypto Crash Is A Preview Of The 'Everything Bubble' Bursting, Sees Bitcoin At $10,000 Again (source: Stocktwits) Mike McGlone said that stocks, gold, commodities, and Treasury yields are next. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/cryptocurrency/bitcoins-warning-mike-mcglone-crypto-crash-everything-bubble/cNbYN5OR9SR  ### Pantoro Gold extends high-grade Racetrack discovery (source: Proactive) Pantoro Gold Ltd managing director Paul Cmrlec talked with Proactive about the latest high-grade drilling results from the Racetrack discovery at the Norseman Gold Project in Western Australia, where continued exploration success has prompted the company to double its surface drilling fleet to six rigs.  Cmrlec said Racetrack continued to deliver strong mineralised widths and very high gold grades, with impressive consistency throughout the system. Unlike neighbouring ore bodies, where high- and low-grade intersections can be mixed, the discovery has so far demonstrated consistent high-grade mineralisation.  Recent drilling has extended the mineralised system another 180 metres down-plunge, while the overall strike length has increased to approximately 1,000 metres. The discovery remains open to the east and at depth, providing further opportunities for exploration.  Cmrlec explained that Pantoro Gold is accelerating drilling and underground development, supported by its funding position and increasing confidence in the discovery's production potential. The company is targeting a maiden Mineral Resource estimate by the end of the financial year, with an ore reserve expected to follow.  The proximity of Racetrack to the existing OK Underground Mine also offers development advantages. By accessing the discovery through existing underground infrastructure, Pantoro Gold expects to avoid substantial new surface infrastructure, helping reduce capital requirements and streamline approvals.  Looking ahead, investors can expect continued drilling updates as six surface rigs operate and underground exploration advances towards closer-spaced drilling and development of the Racetrack ore zone.  For more interviews and updates from the mining and resources sector, visit Proactive's YouTube channel. Don't forget to like this video, subscribe to the channel and enable notifications so you never miss future content.  #PantoroGold #GoldExploration #GoldMining #RacetrackDiscovery #NorsemanGoldProject #ASXPNR #GoldDrilling #MineralResources #WesternAustralia #MiningStocks #GoldDiscovery #ProactiveInvestors Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/video/pantoro-gold-extends-high-grade-021736164.html  ### Australia shares set to slide at open, NZ falls (source: Reuters) Nov 23 (Reuters) - Australian shares were poised to open lower on Monday, with miners likely to take a hit from weaker copper and gold prices, while sentiment remained fragile after last week's soft Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/world-indices/articles/australia-shares-set-slide-open-010723111.html  ### Gold Rebounds as Traders Pare Bets on Near-Term Fed Rate Hikes (source: Bloomberg) Gold rebounded from its biggest weekly decline in eight months as traders scaled back bets on the Federal Reserve raising interest rates in the near term. Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/commodities/articles/gold-rebounds-traders-pare-bets-002803539.html  ### Pantoro Gold hits bonanza grades of 2,726 g/t at Racetrack, doubles drilling fleet to accelerate resource estimate (source: Proactive) Pantoro Gold Ltd (ASX:PNR, OTC:PNTOF) has delivered another round of exceptional gold drilling results at its Racetrack discovery within the Norseman Gold Project in Western Australia, including a bonanza-grade intersection of 0.49 metres at 2,726.49 grams per tonne (g/t) gold. The latest... Link: https://www.proactiveinvestors.com/companies/news/1102218/pantoro-gold-hits-bonanza-grades-of-2-