ia’s latest inflation signals are flashing warning lights, with rising prices and higher unemployment squeezing household budgets and shaking confidence. Growth stories suddenly feel harder to find. That is exactly why financially solid Australian companies, where analysts expect strong earnings expansion over the next few years, look so interesting. This article highlights three such high potential stocks from our screener and explains what makes each one worth a closer look. The... Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/capricorn-metals-2-australian-growth-120844408.html  ### Berkshire Hathaway is betting big on 1 beleaguered US market. Is it too late to get in? (source: Moneywise) Is the company taking a page out of ex-CEO Warren Buffett’s investing playbook? Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/news/berkshire-hathaway-betting-big-1-114500106.html  ### 5 assets that should never (ever) go into a living trust if you love your kids — help them bypass probate when you die (source: Moneywise) A living trust is a great way to pass on your wealth, but it can become a liability if not done correctly. Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/small-business/articles/5-assets-never-ever-living-111500669.html  ### The Great Cash Grab Is Crashing Gold, Silver And Bitcoin, Goldman Sachs Warns The Stock Selloff Isn't Over (source: Stocktwits) The CME Group's FedWatch tool showed traders are pricing in an 88.6% chance of a Fed rate hike at its upcoming December meeting, making liquidity tighter. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/why-gold-silver-and-bitcoin-are-crashing-together-the-great-cash-grab/cNbnYXsR91w  ### Ford Motor (F) Lands $464.5 Million Oakville Backing As Legal Setback Mounts (source: Simply Wall St.) Ford Motor (NYSE:F) secured a C$464.5 million commitment from Canada to support the expansion of its Oakville Assembly Complex. The federal and provincial funding is tied to Ford's multibillion dollar retooling of the Oakville plant for fut